  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> be a symmetric matrix such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;If the sum of the diagonal&nbsp;elements of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math> is equal to _________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Also,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>And,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Tr</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle><mo>&#215;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
